#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:2
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "发布"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:4
msgid ""
"A Cloud Agent release consists of `release.json` and `recipe.tar.gz`. The"
" manifest identifies one source commit, every owned image by registry "
"digest, each image's platforms, the sandbox runtime catalog, the database"
" revision, the deployment protocol, and recorded compatibility checks. "
"The recipe contains scripts and configuration templates for installing "
"those images without a source checkout."
msgstr ""
"一个 Cloud Agent 发布由 `release.json` 和 `recipe.tar.gz` "
"两个文件组成。清单（manifest）里写明了：对应哪一个源 "
"commit；每个自有镜像在镜像仓库里的摘要，以及各自支持的平台；沙箱的运行时目录；数据库修订号；部署协议；还有已经记录的兼容性检查结果。recipe"
" 里是安装这些镜像要用的脚本和配置模板，有了它就不需要源码仓库。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:11
msgid ""
"A downstream distribution pins the SHA-256 of the manifest's exact bytes "
"in its own reviewed lock. The manifest, in turn, pins the recipe archive "
"and images."
msgstr "下游发行版在自己评审过的锁定文件里，固定这份清单原始字节的 SHA-256；清单再反过来固定 recipe 归档和各个镜像。"

