#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:35
msgid ""
"Image references must use digests under this organization's registry. The"
" schema enforces role and web-variant cardinality, and the generator "
"validates its output against that schema before writing it. The generator"
" also checks that each runtime's `default` appears in its `versions`; "
"this relationship cannot be expressed by the published JSON Schema, so "
"consumers must check it separately."
msgstr ""
"镜像引用必须用本组织镜像仓库下的摘要。schema 会限制每种角色和每种 Web 变体各有几个，生成器写出清单之前会先用这个 schema "
"校验一遍。生成器还会检查每个运行时的 `default` 是否在它的 `versions` 里；这层关系没法用对外发布的 JSON Schema "
"表达，所以使用方需要自己另外检查。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:42
msgid ""
"Version fields come from their sources: `deploy_protocol` from "
"`deploy/DEPLOY_PROTOCOL`, `database_revision` from Alembic's script "
"directory, and `runtime_catalog` from the sandbox image's labels. Runtime"
" versions should not be supplied as a second hand-maintained list."
msgstr ""
"版本字段都直接取自各自的来源：`deploy_protocol` 取自 "
"`deploy/DEPLOY_PROTOCOL`，`database_revision` 取自 Alembic "
"的脚本目录，`runtime_catalog` 取自沙箱镜像的标签。不要再另外手工维护一份运行时版本列表。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:47
msgid ""
"The generator does not query the registry. A downstream resolver must "
"verify that each digest exists, carries the declared platforms, and has "
"the expected `org.opencontainers.image.revision` and "
"`io.hybridinference.artifact.role` labels on each platform image. "
"Manifest validation alone does not prove those claims."
msgstr ""
"生成器不会去查镜像仓库。下游的解析器必须自己确认：每个摘要都真实存在，带有声明的那些平台，并且每个平台的镜像上都有预期的 "
"`org.opencontainers.image.revision` 和 `io.hybridinference.artifact.role` "
"标签。清单本身校验通过，并不能证明这些都成立。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:53
msgid "Producing one"
msgstr "生成发布"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:55
msgid ""
"[The publication workflow](../../.github/workflows/publish.yml) handles "
"pushes to `dev`, successful CI completion, and manual dispatch for a "
"`dev` commit with successful CI. A push can build alongside CI, but "
"publication waits for the newest push CI run on that exact commit to "
"succeed. A successful CI rerun can trigger publication later."
msgstr ""
"[发布工作流](../../.github/workflows/publish.yml)会在三种情况下运行：推送到 `dev`、CI "
"成功完成，以及对一个 CI 已通过的 `dev` commit 手动触发。推送触发时可以和 CI 同时构建，但要等这个 commit "
"上最近一次推送触发的 CI 成功，才会真正发布。之后某次 CI 重跑成功，也可以再触发发布。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:61
msgid "The workflow:"
msgstr "工作流的步骤："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:63
msgid ""
"Verifies that the commit is on `dev` and leaves an existing release "
"unchanged."
msgstr "确认这个 commit 在 `dev` 上；如果已经有对应的发布，就不去动它。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:64
msgid ""
"Builds and pushes each artifact by digest with `SOURCE_COMMIT` set to the"
" full commit SHA. It pulls the digest back, smoke-tests the pulled image,"
" and records its digest, platform, and labels."
msgstr ""
"把 `SOURCE_COMMIT` 设为完整的 commit "
"SHA，构建每个产物并按摘要推送。然后把这个摘要拉回来，对拉回的镜像做冒烟测试，记下它的摘要、平台和标签。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:67
msgid ""
"Assembles the six cell records, builds the recipe, and writes the "
"manifest."
msgstr "把六个构建单元的记录汇总起来，构建 recipe，写出清单。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:68
msgid "Runs control-plane integration acceptance on those exact candidate files."
msgstr "对这几个候选文件本身，跑一遍控制平面的集成验收。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:69
msgid ""
"Waits for CI success, creates a draft release tagged `agent-<full-sha>`, "
"uploads both assets, then makes the release visible. A failed upload "
"deletes the draft."
msgstr "等 CI 成功后，创建一个标签为 `agent-<full-sha>` 的草稿发布，上传两个文件，再把发布设为可见。上传失败的话，草稿会被删掉。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:73
msgid ""
"Failed or cancelled CI leaves any built images in the registry without a "
"published manifest. The release workflow has no pull-request trigger and "
"runs merged code. It publishes artifacts; it does not deploy a named "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"如果 CI 失败或被取消，已经构建好的镜像会留在镜像仓库里，但不会有对应的清单发布出来。发布工作流不会被 pull request "
"触发，只跑已经合并的代码。它只负责发布产物，不会部署到任何具体的环境。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:77
msgid ""
"For a manual generation run from the repository root, collect the six "
"publication cell JSON files in `cells/`. Set `SOURCE_COMMIT` to their "
"full 40-character SHA and `PUBLISHER_RUN_URL` to the actual publisher's "
"Actions run URL, then use the same generation commands as the workflow:"
msgstr ""
"如果要在仓库根目录手动生成，先把六个构建单元的 JSON 文件放进 `cells/`。把 `SOURCE_COMMIT` 设为它们完整的 40 位"
" SHA，把 `PUBLISHER_RUN_URL` 设为实际执行发布的那次 Actions 运行的 URL，然后用和工作流相同的命令生成："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:99
msgid ""
"`inputs.json` contains `source_commit`, `artifacts`, and "
"`runtime_labels`. `runtime_labels` is the sandbox's label map from "
"`docker image inspect`, matching what the host reads when stamping "
"attempts. The manifest is written atomically only after all checks pass."
msgstr ""
"`inputs.json` 里有 `source_commit`、`artifacts` 和 "
"`runtime_labels`。`runtime_labels` 是用 `docker image inspect` "
"读出来的沙箱镜像标签，和主机给 attempt 打标记时读到的内容一致。只有全部检查都通过后，清单才会一次性写出，不会出现写了一半的文件。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:104
msgid "Starting, not just building"
msgstr "光能构建还不够，还得能启动"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:106
msgid ""
"[smoke.py](smoke.py) starts each artifact and checks its identity labels."
" CI and publication use the same implementation; publication applies it "
"to images pulled back from the registry."
msgstr ""
"[smoke.py](smoke.py) 会把每个产物启动起来，并检查它的身份标签。CI "
"和发布用的是同一套代码；发布时检查的是从镜像仓库拉回来的镜像。"

