msgstr "能运行入口程序；对端连不上时，会明确地报错退出。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:118
msgid ""
"The tests also check `org.opencontainers.image.revision`, "
"`io.hybridinference.artifact.role`, and the web variant's "
"`io.hybridinference.artifact.base_path`. Dockerfiles default the revision"
" to `unknown`; publication must supply the source commit. These checks "
"establish startup behavior, not successful job execution, real Gateway "
"integration, or Kata readiness on an execution host."
msgstr ""
"测试还会检查 "
"`org.opencontainers.image.revision`、`io.hybridinference.artifact.role`，以及"
" Web 变体的 `io.hybridinference.artifact.base_path`。Dockerfile 里修订号的默认值是 "
"`unknown`，发布时必须传入源 commit。这些检查只能说明镜像能正常启动，说明不了任务能跑成功、和真实网关能对接，也说明不了执行主机上的"
" Kata 已经就绪。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:125
msgid "Control-plane integration acceptance"
msgstr "控制平面集成验收"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:127
msgid ""
"[acceptance.py](acceptance.py) installs the candidate from an extracted "
"recipe in a directory without application source or Dockerfiles. It runs "
"the real control-plane deployer in artifact mode, pulls the candidate "
"digests, and compares running containers with the manifest through "
"[accept_artifacts.py](accept_artifacts.py)."
msgstr ""
"[acceptance.py](acceptance.py) 会在一个既没有应用源码、也没有 Dockerfile 的目录里，用解压出来的 "
"recipe 安装候选版本。它以产物模式运行真实的控制平面部署脚本，拉取候选镜像的摘要，再通过 "
"[accept_artifacts.py](accept_artifacts.py) 拿正在运行的容器和清单逐一比对。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Acceptance establishes"
msgstr "验收能证明的"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Remaining environment acceptance"
msgstr "仍需在实际环境中验收的"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Checkout-free installation with no image build"
msgstr "不需要源码仓库、也不构建镜像就能安装"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Execution host, Kata, and real jobs"
msgstr "执行主机、Kata 和真实任务"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Registry pulls and digest identity of running containers"
msgstr "能从镜像仓库拉取镜像，运行中容器的摘要与清单一致"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Any additional architecture"
msgstr "其他 CPU 架构"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Real Postgres migrations and identity-namespace check"
msgstr "在真实的 Postgres 上完成迁移和身份命名空间检查"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Gateway contracts and browser sign-in"
msgstr "网关契约和浏览器登录"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Healthy API and MCP listeners; correct web variant labels"
msgstr "API 和 MCP 监听器运行正常；Web 变体的标签正确"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "User-visible console behavior"
msgstr "用户在控制台里看到的实际行为"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Refusal of conflicting configured images before pulling"
msgstr "配置里的镜像相互冲突时，在拉取之前就拒绝"

#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Independent registry validation by the downstream resolver"
msgstr "由下游解析器对镜像仓库做独立校验"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:141
msgid ""
"The exact-commit host readiness fence is expected to time out: this "
"acceptance has no execution host. The test asserts that the deploy "
"reached the fence after all earlier stages passed. It does not bypass or "
"weaken that check."
msgstr ""
"按确切 commit "
"判断的主机就绪栅栏，在这里本来就会超时，因为这次验收根本没有执行主机。测试断言的是：前面所有阶段都通过后，部署确实走到了这道栅栏。它不会绕过这项检查，也不会放松它。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:145
msgid ""
"Because normal deployment starts `web` after the fence, acceptance starts"
" it explicitly using the generated Compose file with `--no-build --pull "
"never`. Container comparisons use registry `RepoDigests`, rather than "
"image IDs, and role labels, rather than registry paths. The workflow "
"publishes the same manifest and recipe bytes that passed this acceptance."
msgstr ""
"正常部署要等过了栅栏才启动 `web`，所以验收时会用生成的 Compose 文件，加上 `--no-build --pull "
"never`，手动把它启动起来。比对容器时，用的是镜像仓库的 `RepoDigests` 而不是镜像 "
"ID，看的是角色标签而不是镜像仓库路径。工作流最终发布的清单和 recipe，与通过这次验收的文件逐字节相同。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:151
msgid "Registry layout is not part of this contract"
msgstr "镜像仓库的目录布局不属于这份契约"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:153
msgid ""
"The image's role label defines its role. Repository names and human-"
"readable tags are storage conventions; deployments select the manifest's "
"digests."
msgstr "镜像是什么角色，看它的角色标签。仓库名和方便人看的标签只是存放上的约定；部署时认的是清单里的摘要。"

