msgid "Sandbox, with a separate visibility setting for bundled third-party CLIs"
msgstr "沙箱；因为里面打包了第三方 CLI，单独设置了可见性"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:161
msgid ""
"After its smoke test passes, each digest receives a tag such as "
"`control-<sha>`, `web-agents-<sha>`, or `sandbox-<sha>`. These tags help "
"people inspect images and are not deployment selectors."
msgstr ""
"冒烟测试通过后，每个摘要会打上 `control-<sha>`、`web-agents-<sha>`、`sandbox-<sha>` "
"这样的标签。这些标签只是方便人查看镜像，部署时不靠它们来选镜像。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:165
msgid ""
"Tags such as `buildcache-sandbox-2026-w42` are the publication workflow's"
" layer cache, not images. Only that workflow writes them, and it starts a"
" new one each ISO week. Because a layer whose inputs did not change keeps"
" its digest from one release to the next, a host that runs the previous "
"release pulls only the layers that changed."
msgstr ""
"`buildcache-sandbox-2026-w42` 这类标签是发布工作流的层缓存，不是镜像。只有这个工作流会写入它们，每个 ISO "
"周换一个新的。输入没变的层，在相邻两次发布之间摘要也不变，所以正在运行上一个发布的主机，只需要拉取有变化的那些层。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:171
msgid ""
"When changing registry layout, verify whether the copy preserves the "
"original index digest. Recreating an index or converting its format can "
"change that digest and requires a reviewed lock update. Keep old "
"addresses available until the rollback window closes."
msgstr "调整镜像仓库布局时，要确认复制过去的镜像是否保留了原来的索引摘要。重新创建索引或转换格式都可能让摘要改变，这时就要更新锁定文件并经过评审。在回滚窗口结束之前，旧地址要一直可用。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:176
msgid "Where this differs from the design document"
msgstr "和设计文档不一样的地方"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:178
msgid ""
"The [original release design](../../docs/agents/specs/2026-09-10-cloud-"
"agent-release-fi-deploy-design.zh.md) is historical. The implemented "
"differences are:"
msgstr ""
"[最初的发布设计](../../docs/agents/specs/2026-09-10-cloud-agent-release-fi-"
"deploy-design.zh.md)已经是历史文档了。实际实现和它不同的地方有："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:181
msgid ""
"**Deployment protocol v4.** `shared-live-exact-sha-v4` replaced the "
"design's v2. v3 introduced the schema baseline rewrite; v4 introduced the"
" [single sandbox network](../../docs/agents/specs/2026-09-23-agent-"
"public-egress-design.zh-CN.md). It retired the Squid `egress` artifact "
"and requires `AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` and "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` on every runner host. v3 deployers cannot "
"install v4 releases, and rollback does not cross this protocol boundary."
msgstr ""
"**部署协议是 v4。** 设计里写的是 v2，现在用的是 `shared-live-exact-sha-v4`。v3 引入了 schema "
"baseline 的重写；v4 引入了[单一沙箱网络](../../docs/agents/specs/2026-09-23-agent-"
"public-egress-design.zh-CN.md)，去掉了基于 Squid 的 `egress` 产物，并要求每台 runner "
"主机都配置 `AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` 和 `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`。v3 "
"的部署脚本装不了 v4 的发布，回滚也不能跨过这条协议边界。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:188
msgid ""
"**Six images from five Dockerfiles.** The web Dockerfile builds twice "
"because the mount prefix is compiled into the bundle. The retired egress "
"image accounts for the original design's seventh artifact."
msgstr ""
"**五个 Dockerfile 产出六个镜像。** Web 的 Dockerfile "
"要构建两次，因为挂载前缀是编译进前端包里的。最初设计里的第七个产物，就是现在已经退役的 egress 镜像。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:191
msgid ""
"**Existing runtime-label namespace.** Runtime labels remain "
"`org.freeinference.runtime.*`. Renaming them requires a separate dual-"
"read migration."
msgstr ""
"**运行时标签沿用原来的命名空间。** 运行时标签仍然叫 "
"`org.freeinference.runtime.*`。要改名，需要单独做一次新旧名字同时读取的迁移。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:195
msgid "Deploying a recipe"
msgstr "部署 recipe"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:197
msgid ""
"Verify the manifest against the downstream lock, verify the recipe's "
"SHA-256 against the manifest, and resolve and verify its image digests "
"before replacing services. Extract `recipe.tar.gz` into a release "
"directory; it creates a `recipe/` directory containing deployment "
"helpers, examples, and Compose templates without `build:` entries."
msgstr ""
"替换服务之前，先拿下游的锁定文件核对清单，拿清单核对 recipe 的 SHA-256，再解析并核对各个镜像的摘要。把 "
"`recipe.tar.gz` 解压到一个发布目录里，会得到一个 `recipe/` 目录，里面有部署辅助脚本、配置示例，以及不含 "
"`build:` 的 Compose 模板。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:203
msgid ""
"Both machines need Bash, Docker with Compose v2, and Python 3.12 or newer"
" for recipe helpers. The execution host additionally needs its existing "
"Kata provisioning; deployment does not install a sandbox runtime. Install"
" the helper dependencies on each machine:"
msgstr ""
"两台机器都需要 Bash、带 Compose v2 的 Docker，以及 Python 3.12 或更新版本（recipe "
"的辅助脚本要用）。执行主机还需要事先配置好 Kata；部署过程不会帮你安装沙箱运行时。在每台机器上安装辅助脚本的依赖："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:214
msgid ""
"Keep `DEPLOY_ROOT` stable across releases. Its `.env`, `.deployed-sha`, "
"and `.shared-live-ready` describe the persistent deployment, while each "
"extracted recipe can live elsewhere. For a new installation, create that "
"root and fill its `.env` using the appropriate recipe's control-plane or "
"host `.env.example`. For an existing installation, retain its "
"configuration, Compose project name, host enrollment root, and Docker "
"data root. Generated Compose files stay under `DEPLOY_ROOT` so relative "
"mounts preserve their data paths; the edge proxy configuration comes from"
" the selected recipe."
msgstr ""
"`DEPLOY_ROOT` 在不同的发布之间不要变。它下面的 `.env`、`.deployed-sha` 和 `.shared-live-"
"ready` 描述的是这套长期存在的部署，而每次解压出来的 recipe 可以放在别的地方。全新安装时，创建这个根目录，参照对应 recipe "
"里控制平面或主机的 `.env.example` 填好 `.env`。已有的安装，则保留原来的配置、Compose 项目名、主机注册根目录和 "
"Docker 数据目录。生成的 Compose 文件放在 `DEPLOY_ROOT` 下，这样相对路径的挂载还能指向原来的数据；edge "
"代理的配置则来自所选的 recipe。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:223
msgid ""
"Select `AGENT_WEB_VARIANT=root` or `agents` in the control-plane "
"configuration. If omitted, `AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH` selects the variant: "
"empty or unset selects `root`, and `/agents` selects `agents`."
msgstr ""
"在控制平面配置里，用 `AGENT_WEB_VARIANT=root` 或 `agents` 选择 Web 变体。不设置的话，就看 "
"`AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH`：为空或没设置时用 `root`，设为 `/agents` 时用 `agents`。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:227
msgid "Set the artifact environment on the control-plane machine:"
msgstr "在控制平面机器上设置产物模式的环境变量："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:236
msgid ""
"Set the same release and interpreter on the execution host, with its own "
"root:"
msgstr "在执行主机上设置同一个发布和同一个解释器，但用它自己的根目录："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:245
msgid ""
"The manifest supplies the commit and owned image references. Remove old "
"image and commit overrides when moving to artifact mode; any conflicting "
"effective Compose values are refused before pulling or replacing "
"services. The default `source` mode remains available for checkout-based "
"deployment."
msgstr ""
"commit 和自有镜像的引用都由清单提供。切换到产物模式时，要把以前覆盖镜像和 commit 的设置删掉；最终生效的 Compose "
"值只要有冲突，在拉取镜像或替换服务之前就会被拒绝。默认的 `source` 模式仍然可以用于基于源码仓库的部署。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:250
msgid "Deploying the two in the order the design specifies"
msgstr "按设计规定的顺序部署两台机器"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:252
msgid ""
"Use phases to coordinate the machines. With the environment above set in "
"each machine's shell, run these commands in order:"
msgstr "用阶段（phase）来协调两台机器。在每台机器的 shell 里设好上面的环境变量，然后按顺序执行："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:255
msgid ""
"Prepare both sides; these commands may run in parallel on their "
"respective machines and replace no serving services."
msgstr "两边各自做准备。这两条命令可以在各自的机器上同时跑，不会替换任何正在服务的服务。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:265
msgid ""
"Prepare the database on the control-plane machine. This migrates and "
"checks the identity namespace. On a cold machine it also starts the API "
"and MCP listener needed by the host readiness probes; existing listeners "
"stay in place."
msgstr ""
"在控制平面机器上准备数据库：执行迁移，并检查身份命名空间。如果是从零开始的机器，还会启动主机就绪探测要用到的 API 和 MCP "
"监听器；已有的监听器保持不动。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:273
msgid ""
"Activate the execution host. It drains and replaces runners, checks the "
"replacement, records the deployment, and publishes its generation."
msgstr "激活执行主机：排空并替换 runner，检查新 runner，记录这次部署，并发布这台主机的新代次。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:280
msgid ""
"Activate the control plane. The readiness fence must pass before public "
"services switch."
msgstr "激活控制平面：必须先通过就绪栅栏，对外的服务才会切换过去。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:287
msgid ""
"Omitting `--phase` runs all phases for that side. Use the phased sequence"
" for a coordinated rollout; two whole-script invocations cannot express "
"the ordering above. Phases can be retried. Database preparation retains "
"ownership of any listeners it started, and activation restarts those "
"stopped during a failed attempt so they can accept the heartbeat the "
"readiness fence needs."
msgstr ""
"不加 `--phase` "
"会把这一边的所有阶段一口气跑完。要协调两台机器上线，就得按阶段执行；整段脚本各跑一次，是没办法保证上面这个顺序的。每个阶段都可以重试。数据库准备阶段会一直掌管它自己启动的监听器；激活阶段会把上次失败时停掉的监听器重新启动，好让它们能收到就绪栅栏需要的心跳。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:293
msgid ""
"If the other machine fails and activation is abandoned, clean up "
"listeners started solely for this cold deployment on the control-plane "
"machine:"
msgstr "如果另一台机器失败了、决定放弃这次激活，就在控制平面机器上，把只为这次从零部署而启动的监听器清理掉："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:300
msgid ""
"This leaves previously serving listeners alone. Image pulls and host Kata"
" checks precede runner drain. Migrations, identity-namespace "
"verification, exact-commit readiness, reverse-sandbox-manager probes, and"
" deferred host readiness publication keep their deployment ordering. A "
"failed readiness check prevents activation of the replacement control-"
"plane stack."
msgstr ""
"之前就在服务的监听器不受影响。镜像拉取和主机的 Kata 检查都在排空 runner 之前完成。迁移、身份命名空间核对、按确切 commit "
"的就绪判断、反向 sandbox manager "
"探测，以及延后发布的主机就绪状态，都按原定的部署顺序进行。只要就绪检查失败，新的控制平面服务就不会被激活。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:306
msgid ""
"Script tests run extracted recipes with Docker calls recorded and "
"failures injected, and use the real Compose environment parser when "
"available. They do not establish readiness of a particular Linux host, "
"live Kata runtime, or registry release; verify those during environment "
"cutover."
msgstr ""
"脚本测试会在解压出来的 recipe 上运行，期间记录所有 Docker 调用并注入故障；如果环境里有真实的 Compose "
"环境变量解析器，也会用上。但这些测试证明不了某台具体的 Linux 主机、真实运行的 "
"Kata，或者镜像仓库里的某个发布已经就绪；这些要在实际切换环境时逐一确认。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:311
msgid "What a downstream deployment still owns"
msgstr "下游部署仍要自己负责的事"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:313
msgid ""
"The upstream publication workflow does not deploy a named environment. A "
"consuming distribution must:"
msgstr "上游的发布工作流不会部署到任何具体的环境。使用它的发行版必须："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:316
msgid ""
"pin the exact manifest bytes in a reviewed lock and verify the schema, "
"recipe hash, registry digests, image labels, and platforms;"
msgstr "在评审过的锁定文件里固定清单的原始字节，并核对 schema、recipe 哈希、镜像仓库摘要、镜像标签和平台；"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:318
msgid ""
"check protocol compatibility and the manifest's `verified_upgrade_from` "
"and `verified_rollback_to` records; an empty list means that path was not"
" verified;"
msgstr ""
"检查协议是否兼容，并查看清单里的 `verified_upgrade_from` 和 `verified_rollback_to` "
"记录；列表为空，说明这条升级或回滚路径没有验证过；"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:320
msgid ""
"run preparation, Kata checks, and environment acceptance on the actual "
"hosts;"
msgstr "在实际的主机上执行准备阶段、Kata 检查和环境验收；"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:321
msgid ""
"keep environment configuration, deployment records, and recovery material"
" outside this upstream repository."
msgstr "环境配置、部署记录和恢复材料都放在这个上游仓库之外。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:324
msgid ""
"Retain previous verified manifests, recipes, reviewed hashes and digest-"
"addressed images separately from the persistent deployment roots. "
"Artifact-mode host rollouts receive only one manifest and cannot "
"automatically select an older release. Follow the [backup and recovery "
"runbook](../../docs/developer/disaster-recovery.md#recover-a-previous-"
"artifact-release) to check database/protocol compatibility and run the "
"same phased readiness sequence with a previous verified recipe; a "
"previous release is not automatically compatible with newer installed "
"migrations."
msgstr ""
"之前验证过的清单、recipe、评审过的哈希和按摘要寻址的镜像，要和长期使用的部署根目录分开保存。产物模式下，主机上线时只拿到一份清单，没法自动选用更早的发布。请按[备份与恢复手册](../../docs/developer"
"/disaster-recovery.md#recover-a-previous-artifact-"
"release)检查数据库和部署协议是否兼容，然后用上一个验证过的 "
"recipe，走同样的分阶段就绪流程。注意，上一个发布并不一定兼容已经装上的、更新的迁移。"

